  "details": "Client 1:\n\n* Open/Go to instance of shared group which requires you to have a specific role to enter\n\nClient 2:\n\n* Only part of the group but with wrong role (not allowed to enter instance)\n\nBug: Client 2 (friend with client 1) can now see the previously hidden group instance but can't join. Hitting join button does nothing. No popup which tells the user that something is missing.\n\nEither the instance need to be private and there need to be a popup which tells the user why they can't join",
